'Farmer record saved on this device':'Amakuru y’umuhinzi yabitswe kuri iki gikoresho','Planted quantity cannot exceed received quantity':'Umubare w’ibyatewe ntushobora kuruta uw’ingemwe zakiriwe','Remaining quantity looks higher than the balance':'Umubare w’ingemwe zisigaye urenze ibisigaye bibarwa','Survey saved':'Ibarura ryabitswe','Report saved':'Raporo yabitswe','Correct! Always verify with approved project guidance.':'Ni byo! Buri gihe genzura ukoresheje amabwiriza y’umushinga yemewe.','Not quite. Confirm the instruction using approved project guidance or your technical supervisor.':'Si byo neza. Emeza amabwiriza ukoresheje inyandiko zemewe z’umushinga cyangwa umuyobozi wa tekiniki.','Please select an answer.':'Hitamo igisubizo kimwe.','Learning objective':'Intego y’isomo','Lesson':'Isomo','Key concept':'Igitekerezo cy’ingenzi','Field application':'Uko isomo rikoreshwa mu murima','Operational reminder:':'Icyitonderwa ku mikorere:','This lesson is for learning. Follow current approved Tubura FLR SOPs, species lists, package designs, safety rules and supervisor instructions for field decisions.':'Iri somo rigamije kongera ubumenyi. Mu gufata ibyemezo byo mu murima, kurikiza amabwiriza ya Tubura FLR yemewe, urutonde rw’ubwoko bw’ibiti, ibisobanuro by’amapaki, amabwiriza y’umutekano n’inama za supervisor.','Further reading':'Andi makuru wasoma','Quick knowledge check':'Ibibazo byo gusuzuma ubumenyi','What should you do when a species, spacing or package instruction is not confirmed?':'Wakora iki niba ubwoko bw’igiti, intera yo gutera cyangwa amabwiriza y’ipaki bitaremezwa?','Guess using a different project or package':'Gukeka uko bikorwa mu wundi mushinga cyangwa ipaki','Check the approved project guidance or ask the technical supervisor':'Kugenzura amabwiriza y’umushinga yemewe cyangwa kubaza supervisor wa tekiniki','Leave the information out and report it as complete':'Kureka ayo makuru ariko ukavuga ko raporo yuzuye','Check answer':'Suzuma igisubizo','Correct! Always verify with approved project guidance.':'Ni byo! Buri gihe genzura ukoresheje amabwiriza y’umushinga yemewe.','Not quite. Confirm the instruction using approved project guidance or your technical supervisor.':'Si byo neza. Emeza amabwiriza ukoresheje inyandiko zemewe z’umushinga cyangwa umuyobozi wa tekiniki.','← All lessons':'← Subira ku masomo yose',
'Karongi Itoshye':'Karongi Itoshye','Inshuti z’Igiti':'Inshuti z’Igiti','Abarinzi z’Igiti':'Abarinzi z’Igiti','Intumwa z’Isi Itoshye':'Intumwa z’Isi Itoshye',
'Contour':'Ku mirongo y’iringaniza ubutaka','Boundary':'Ku mbibi z’umurima','Intercropping':'Mu bihingwa hagati','To confirm':'Biracyagenzurwa',
